{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，该买些什么好呢～」", "text_idx": 132, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1565", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是，要买东西的是我来着」", "text_idx": 134, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了好了别多嘴了。你只要好好付钱就可以了」", "text_idx": 135, "plain": "「好了好了别多嘴了。你只要好好付钱就可以了」", "plain_idx": 135, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1566", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到底是怎么回事呢……」", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结业式结束后，我和纱凪约好一起来到了街上。", "text_idx": 138, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "来这的目的是为了买给美羽学姐的圣诞节礼物。", "text_idx": 139, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……本该是这样来着。\\n但不知道为什么，感觉纱凪现在只是在想着买自己想要的东西。", "text_idx": 140, "plain": "……本该是这样来着。但不知道为什么，感觉纱凪现在只是在想着买自己想要的东西。", "plain_idx": 141, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇啊，真想要这个黑猫抱枕——」", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1567", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这个不觉得很像“新吾”吗？啊、我说的是猫的“新吾”，猫的那个」", "text_idx": 144, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1568", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我确认一下，我们是来给美羽学姐买礼物的对吧？」", "text_idx": 146, "plain": "「我确认一下，我们是来给美羽学姐买礼物的对吧？」", "plain_idx": 146, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好可爱，这个玩偶真是太可爱了～黑猫和白猫是一套的吗……姆姆姆」", "text_idx": 147, "plain": "「好可爱，这个玩偶真是太可爱了～黑猫和白猫是一套的吗……姆姆姆」", "plain_idx": 147, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1569", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不行了，她已经完全沉浸在自己的物欲中了。", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但没办法，我实在想不出学姐会喜欢的东西。", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟是学姐，无论送她什么她都会表现得很开心。", "text_idx": 151, "plain": "毕竟是学姐，无论送她什么她都会表现得很开心。", "plain_idx": 151, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来，这个时候情侣真多呀……」", "text_idx": 152, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1570", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，毕竟快到圣诞节了」", "text_idx": 154, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「该不会我们俩在别人看来也是情侣吧？」", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1571", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「无论怎么看都只是关系很好的同学吧」", "text_idx": 157, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说的也是呢」", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1572", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔～～～～嗯……」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1573", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在犹豫什么？」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好想要那个黑猫和白猫的玩偶呀」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1574", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谁想？」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然是我」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1575", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好好好，那赶紧到下一家店去吧……」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来她完全没有给学姐买礼物的想法呢。", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "天色也开始变暗了，要开始认真点考虑了。", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来，你就没有什么想法吗？」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1576", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯……戒指之类的？」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「笨蛋吗，那个也太早了吧。\\n　你还是买个放有很多点心的袜子吧」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": "「笨蛋吗，那个也太早了吧。　你还是买个放有很多点心的袜子吧」", "plain_idx": 175, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1577", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又不是送给小孩子……」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总而言之，戒指还是别想了。我说真的」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1578", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只不过还是想买一个能经常一起带出来的东西呢」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": "「只不过还是想买一个能经常一起带出来的东西呢」", "plain_idx": 180, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔姆，能带出来的东西吗……」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1579", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪依依不舍地把猫咪玩偶放了回去，环顾了一下四周。", "text_idx": 183, "plain": "纱凪依依不舍地把猫咪玩偶放了回去，环顾了一下四周。", "plain_idx": 183, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，这个卡包怎么样？毕业之后学姐也会经常坐电车不是吗」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": "「啊，这个卡包怎么样？毕业之后学姐也会经常坐电车不是吗」", "plain_idx": 184, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1580", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「卡包吗……也是。这里就偷偷把我的照片放进去……」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": "「卡包吗……也是。这里就偷偷把我的照片放进去……」", "plain_idx": 186, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「给我住手」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1581", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「开玩笑的开玩笑的，这个猫的设计也很可爱呢。\\n　好，就选这个吧」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": "「开玩笑的开玩笑的，这个猫的设计也很可爱呢。　好，就选这个吧」", "plain_idx": 190, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1582", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，这样就搞定了。\\n　要好好包装好再送给学姐哦」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": "「好了，这样就搞定了。　要好好包装好再送给学姐哦」", "plain_idx": 194, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1583", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那接下来就是买那个白猫和黑猫的玩偶吧？」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶……」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1584", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是陪我挑选礼物的谢礼」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「笨、笨蛋吗你是。你这样做的话，美羽学姐会伤心的」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": "「笨、笨蛋吗你是。你这样做的话，美羽学姐会伤心的」", "plain_idx": 200, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1585", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「会吗？我觉得学姐在这里的话，也会这么做的」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": "「会吗？我觉得学姐在这里的话，也会这么做的」", "plain_idx": 202, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1586", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事的。我不会做让她伤心的事的」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
